# Audit for Member-Facing Persistence

For changes matching `globs`, apply this rule when the change adds or modifies create/update/delete-equivalent behavior reachable from UI or authenticated API.

**Source of truth**: [`docs/rules/audit-ui-persistence.md`](../../docs/rules/audit-ui-persistence.md)

Summary: Controller passes authenticated user/member ID into Service. Service constructs the project's existing audit context/value. Repository writes bind those audit values. Positive-path SIT asserts persisted DB audit values.
